        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "With these steps, you are now equipped to begin using Gemma 3n in your projects. Next, we\u2019ll explore fine-tuning the Gemma 3n in a free Google Colab."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
